    "description": {
      "value": "<p><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\"><em style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(248, 244, 241);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">奇物，極珍稀（需要同調）</em><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(248, 244, 241);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" />這塊拳頭大小的紫水晶被注入了紫水晶龍扭曲引力的能力。當你持用這塊磁石時，你在力量豁免上具有優勢。<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(248, 244, 241);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" />磁石有 6發充能，當你持用這塊磁石時可以消耗充能使用以下特性。磁石在每日黎明時恢復1d6發充能。<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(248, 244, 241);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" /><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(248, 244, 241);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">飛行。</strong>以一個附贈動作，你可以消耗1發充能在十分鐘內獲得飛行的能力。在此期間你獲得等同於你的步行速度的飛行速度，並且可以懸浮。<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(248, 244, 241);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" /><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(248, 244, 241);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">引力猛推。</strong>以一個動作，你可以消耗一發充能將引力集中在60尺內一個你能看到的生物周圍，目標必須通過一個DC18的力量豁免，否則朝你選擇的方向被推出20尺。<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(248, 244, 241);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" /><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(248, 244, 241);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">反轉重力。</strong>以一個動作，你可以消耗3發充能通過磁石施展一道法術<em style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track)\">反轉重力</em>（豁免DC18）</span></p>",
